This thread is getting quite long, and a lot of good ideas have been
suggested. I thought I'd take a minute to summarise what we've
discussed so far. I've taken the liberty of marking my favourites with
a [+].

I think we should try to make artifact weapons more diverse in their
usefulness, so that there isn't one "ultimate all-purpose artifact".
But I agree with whoever said that they don't want to always be
swapping weapons depending on what monster they are up against.
Rather, I think that certain artifacts should be useful for certain
classes at particular stages of the game. I would have no problem, for
instance, if a particular weapon was good for the early or mid-game,
only to be replaced by something more appropriate when you get to
Gehennom, or to the planes.

I also think that having "-bane" artifacts which convey the powers of
the monster they oppose seems inappropriate.

